    "problem": "Which of the following is the correct symbolic notation for the sentence given below?\n\n*\"The function $f$ maps the set of real numbers to the set $Y.$\"*",
    "worked_solution": "The sentence *\"The function $f$ maps the set of real numbers to the set $Y$\"* is equivalent to the following symbolic notation:\n\n$\\,$ $f:R\\to Y$\n\nHere, the domain of $f$ is $R,$ and the codomain of $f$ is $Y.$",
